[SIZE=6][B]XLobby[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4]A minimalist, performance-focused lobby plugin for Paper servers.[/SIZE][/CENTER]

[B]XLobby gives your server the essential lobby features without bundling an oversized suite of unrelated systems.[/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]/lobby and /spawn[/B] — safely enter the lobby from any world
[*][B]Join and respawn teleporting[/B] — disabled, first join, or every join
[*][B]Void rescue[/B] — return players safely without constant polling
[*][B]Safe teleporting[/B] — spawn validation, asynchronous chunk loading, warmups, cooldowns, and movement or damage cancellation
[*][B]Join presentation[/B] — separate first-join and returning-player messages, titles, sounds, broadcasts, and harmless fireworks
[*][B]Lightweight lobby protection[/B] — independently control damage, hunger, building, item actions, creature spawning, and weather
[*][B]Clear protection feedback[/B] — separate configurable denial messages with anti-spam protection
[*][B]Bossbar[/B] — rotating Adventure messages with configurable colors and overlays
[*][B]Placeholder support[/B] — built-in placeholders, MiniMessage formatting, and optional PlaceholderAPI integration
[*][B]Reliable configuration[/B] — automatically adds new entries, preserves existing values, repairs invalid settings, and backs up malformed YAML
[*][B]Admin tools[/B] — /xlobby setspawn, reload, check, and info with separate permissions and filtered tab completion
[/LIST]

[B]Requirements:[/B] Java 21 and Paper 1.21.x. PlaceholderAPI is optional.

